<title>ESTONIA: Estonian June unemployment down to 3.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Estonian June unemployment down to 3.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment decreased to 3.7 percent in June compared to May's 4.2 percent, the Labour Board said on Friday.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     June '97   May '97   June '96</p>
<p> Percent unemployed	  3.7	  4.2	 4.1</p>
<p> Number unemployed	   32,280     36,450    35,092</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
